    <title>Anthropic warns infostealer malware is hijacking Claude sessions to drain usage</title>
    <link href="https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/artificial-intelligence/anthropic-warns-infostealer-malware-is-hijacking-claude-sessions-to-drain-usage/" rel="alternate"/>
